    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an heir of House Deneith, you were trained for battle—not to seek it, but never to flee from it. You learned the value of duty and honor, and of the laws that keep society in order when duty and honor fail. While making a name for yourself in the house, you may have served as a minor dignitary's bodyguard, as a mercenary, or as a marshal hunting fugitives. Now you are ready to claim your rightful place in the mightiest of the dragonmarked houses.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.UTLh8orHGmrTwMVy]{Mark of Sentinel}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight and Perception</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepSpear00000]{Spear}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepShortbow00]{Shortbow}, 20 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbamoArrows0000]{Arrows}, Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesFine]{Fine Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHealersKit0]{Healer's Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagQuiver00000]{Quiver}, 1 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
